## Purpose
Splitting Configuration files for bug count notebook, similar to issue #359 .

Currently, configuration files are mixed with both config data types, immutable and mutable data. Will be making it so that the notebooks will take two configurations when running analyses, one for project and another for analysis. 

Will be working with the one notebook bug_count.Rmd. Associated notebook runs with geronimo.yml config file. Geronimo has been previously split in jira/mail notebooks #376 . We already have a geronimo_immutable.yml project file and associated analysis configs. Will just be double checking if the split works with the bug count notebook, which it should if everything is right. I will be focusing on analyzing bug count notebook and making it so that the notebook can take the split immutable and mutable config files.

